   "data": {
    "text": "SET DESIGN\nPatch any CV (0 to 10 V) into a jack. 0 V is the item's From setting, 10 V its To.\n\nCV-CC 1: MIDI channel 5, CC 97 to 112\n   1 Era and style of the place\n   2 Main material\n   3 Soft curves to sharp clean lines\n   4 Art on the walls\n   5 How the art is arranged\n   6 Clutter\n   7 Cramped to open\n   8 Run down to spotless\n   9 Layers behind the people\n  10 Dark to bright colors\n  11 How the room is laid out\n  12 Props\n  13 Scattered things\n  14 suite: Set design lens\n  15 suite: Dive bar\n  16 suite: Upscale lounge\nCV-CC 2: MIDI channel 6, CC 1 to 11\n   1 suite: Period piece\n   2 suite: Cold minimalism\n   3 suite: Warm maximalism\n   4 suite: Lived-in home\n   5 pair: When the clutter rises, the room feels more cramped\n   6 pair: When the place runs down, the clothes wear out too\n   7 pair: In a cluttered room, the shots get closer\n   8 pair: In a huge space, the frame goes wide\n   9 pair: A key prop gets its close-up\n  10 pair: A run-down room darkens the mood\n  11 pairs: The set steers the camera"
   },
